      "content": "Hey, I'm prepping for a moot court competition on executive privilege and congressional oversight. I'm stuck on the core debate. In the context of modern governance, is the expansion of executive privilege a necessary protection for the presidency or a dangerous erosion of checks and balances? Pick the stronger legal position for me to build my argument around.",
